      "tree": {
        "sha": "4fe4eaa1c7bcc21888b12d759b5e41e47236f02d",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/4fe4eaa1c7bcc21888b12d759b5e41e47236f02d"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 4fe4eaa1c7bcc21888b12d759b5e41e47236f02d\nparent a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792792474 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792874108 +0200\n\ntorcontrol: Only read a regular file as authentication cookie\n\nThe path of the cookie file comes from the reply to PROTOCOLINFO, so\nwhatever answers on the control port chooses it. A FIFO with no writer\nmade fopen() block the torcontrol thread for good, and shutdown waits\nfor that thread.\n\nCheck that the path is a regular file before reading it, and log a\nwarning if it is not or cannot be examined. Also have ReadBinaryFile\nopen the file with O_NONBLOCK on POSIX systems, so that a file replaced\nby a FIFO after the check cannot block either.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRJ5SMZs3eEinN+Lb4iedqLwmlHIAUCat0WfBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQInnai8JpRyAXrQEA/O2EVPxCLtgRUIKSYBN1\neK4ObjCNrqgFfpJ8j4Jh+MkBAJvhYd7CsJrX0vbXJp05PlarphyE3sWCH6MRmkGC\ntGgB\n=jH9a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
      },
      "parents": [
        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48",
          "sha": "a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48"
