        "payload": "tree 707ba36fbc820b26a97bf6ab5ce74be6cd72904d\nparent e445a64d7e90c038479e65e10547ce00efa7460c\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792799965 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792874108 +0200\n\ndoc: Say that the Tor control port is trusted\n\nBitcoin Core connects to 127.0.0.1:9051 by default whenever it listens,\neven if Tor is not running. Document that whatever answers there is\ntrusted, for instance for the onion address the node advertises.\n",
